</bold>D.T. received the support of fellowships from 'la Caixa' Foundation (ID 100010434). The fellowship code was &#x0201c;LCF/BQ/DR21/11880018.&#x0201d; F.V. receives the support of fellowship grant 2025 &#x0201c;FI-1 01003&#x0201d; from &#x0201c;Ajuts Joan Or&#x000f3; per a la contractaci&#x000f3; de personal investigador en formaci&#x000f3;, Ag&#x000e8;ncia de Gesti&#x000f3; d'Ajuts Universitaris i de Recerca &#x02013; FI 2025 (AGAUR-FI).&#x0201d; N.B. was supported by an FPU predoctoral fellowship from the Spanish Ministry of Universities (Ministerio de Universidades) (FPU18/04260). R.V. is supported by ARISTOS, which has received funding from the European Union's HORIZON EUROPE Research and Innovation Programme under Marie Sklodowska-Curie grant agreement No. 101081334. ISGlobal acknowledges support from grant CEX2023&#x02013;0001290-S, funded by MCIN/AEI/10.13039/501100011033, and support from the Generalitat de Catalunya through the CERCA Program (Centres de Recerca de Catalunya). This project has received funding from the European Union's HORIZON EUROPE Research and Innovation Programme under grant agreement No. 101057114. CISM is supported by the Government of Mozambique and the Spanish Agency for International Development (Agencia Espa&#x000f1;ola de Cooperaci&#x000f3;n Internacional para el Desarrollo, AECID).</p></ack><sec id="ofaf724-s4"><title>Supplementary Data</title><p>Supplementary materials are available at <italic toggle="yes"><xref rid="sup1" ref-type="supplementary-material">Open Forum Infectious Diseases</xref></italic> online. Consisting of data provided by the authors to benefit the reader, the posted materials are not copyedited and are the sole responsibility of the authors, so questions or comments should be addressed to the corresponding author.</p></sec><ref-list id="ref1"><title>References</title><ref id="ofaf724-B1"><label>1</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book">
