</person-group>. <source>WHO Informal Consultation on Fever Management in Peripheral Health Care Settings: A Global Review of Evidence and Practice</source>. <publisher-name>World Health Organization</publisher-name>; <year>2013</year>.</mixed-citation></ref><ref id="ofaf724-B2"><label>2</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal">
